{title: Thendrale}
{artist: A R Rahman Kadhal Desam}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D]Thendralae thendralae,        mella nee veesu
poovudan melle nee peesu,        [D]karaiyin madiyil [G]nadhiyum thoongum
[A]kavalai marandhu thoongu,        [D]iravin madiyil [G]ulagam thoongum
[A]iniya kanavil thoongu,        [D]Thendralae thendralae
[G]mella nee veesu,        poovudan [D]melle nee peesu
[D]Kaadhal endraal kavalaiya,        [G]kannil neerin [A]thivala [G]iya
[Bm]noya [A]an [G]en,        uyirum [Bm]neeya [A]na [G]en
[D]iravil kaayum [D]muzhu nila,        [Bm]enakku mattum [G]sudum nila
[D]vaarai [A]yo enai nee [D]serai [A]yo,        [Gm]thoonga vaikkum nilavae
[A]thookamindri neeaen vaadinaiyo,        [D]Thendralae thendralae
[G]mella nee veesu,        poovudan [D]mella nee peesu
[G]maalai vaanil [D]kadhirum saiyum,        [G]madiyil saaindhu [D]thoongada
[G]boomi yaavum [D]thoongum podhu,        [G]poovai neeyum [D]thoongada
[Bm]malarin kaadhal [G]panikku theriyum,        en [D]manadhin kaadhal [Em]theriyu [Bm]maa
solla varthai [D]kodi [G]dhan,        unnai [D]neril kandaal [Em]mounamen
[D]thoonga vaikka paadinen naan,        [Gm]thookamindri [A]vaadinen
